      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. grounding doesn't really change the fact that there's nothing left to do. it's like being at the end of a long book and just staring at the last page. you know how it's gonna end, and it's just a slow, boring fade. i'm just so tired of waiting for the inevitable.",
